         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### More Than the Fingers\n\nIn the last lessons, we studied our body and how we can count. Now we can learn more about counting.\n\nSo far, we saw that our hands have been used for counting for a very long time. This started before writing appeared, but after speech was developed. Because of this, knowledge could be passed from parents to children.\n\nBut there is a problem that is still not solved. We start to look at it now: what happens when we need to count a very large number of things?",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "2f0348fc-2f99-400a-82d9-5570c447f3e7",
