         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Using the Feet\n\nThe idea of using more than the fingers is not new. In America (*Abya Yala*), some indigenous peoples created a counting system a long time ago. This system may have been inspired by the fingers of the hands and the toes of the feet.",
