            {
               "text": "#### Better, but It Can Still Improve\n\nCounting with our feet is a step forward. But we would still have problems counting very large numbers of things.\n\nWe could ask more and more people to help us. But what if there are not enough people?\n\nThis shows that we need to use our body as inspiration to create something new.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
