         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this lesson, we saw that our feet can help us count. They very likely inspired peoples in America (*Abya Yala*). But they are not the final solution for counting.\n\nIn the next lessons, we will see which solutions were used around the world for counting.",
